{"ts":"2026-08-29T10:26:18.894Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"99c265bc79d0025f861b6e66","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"ops-5jp6"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"A heredoc body and a discarded binding both let an unattested publish pass the attestation gate"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Two shapes the scalar index modelled wrongly, each measured as a clean pass on a file the shell would publish unattested from. A heredoc body is stdin data and binds nothing, but an assignment written inside one was indexed, so npm publish $FLAG borrowed a flag the shell never passed. And unset FLAG discards a binding the index kept forever, so a publish after the unset borrowed a flag that was no longer set. Eleven probe shapes returned zero failures against the canonical implementation before this change."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:gates","area:supply-chain","type:security"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-29T10:26:18.894Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-29T10:26:18.894Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"b06ddb1f77094f910d060a553e5caae75952486163b5052f245655262b6e8fc2","item_hash_version":2,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_sess