{"ts":"2026-08-29T10:26:26.776Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"99c265bc79d0025f861b6e66","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-29T10:26:26.776Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Heredoc bodies bind no scalar in any of the seven spellings; unset discards a binding in all four spellings; bindings resolve positionally so a later assignment cannot attest an earlier publish; publish detection inside a heredoc is unchanged; every new test fails when the behaviour is reverted."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"critical"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"critical"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Call auditPublishAttestation on a single source holding 'cat <<EOF' / 'FLAG=--provenance' / 'EOF' / 'npm publish --access public $FLAG'. The shell passes no flag; the audit returns no failures. Same for 'FLAG=--provenance' / 'unset FLAG' / 'npm publish --access public $FLAG'."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Every file the shell would publish unattested from is reported as a failure, whatever spelling routes the flag."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Eleven probe shapes returned zero failures: seven heredoc spellings and four unset spellings."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"scripts/shell-command-scan.ts (shellScalarsByLine, heredocBodyLines)"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"A release in any package carrying this gate could publish an unattested artifact while its supply-chain gate reported green."}],"before_hash":"b06ddb1f77094f910d060a553e5caae75952486163b5052f245655262b6e8fc2","after_hash":"a08266bb8b4c9836320e2bc6755e0dd48c1755568523cb3ed278e1a1e00b